  - estuaries
  - seagrass
  - Nanozostera noltei
abstract: >-
  MAREA maps intertidal elevation, its uncertainty and emersion time at 10 m
  from Sentinel-2 openEO data cubes. It reads from the images one delay of
  the tide for each 3-km section along the channel (zero at the mouth, never
  decreasing inland), gives every pixel a delay from a smooth curve through
  the section delays, shifts the tide at the mouth by it, and then fits the
  elevation of every pixel. This branch is the companion repository
  of the poster presented at CARTOGRASS 2026: the method's library, example
  notebooks on real data, a small real sample with its tide, the offline
  replication kit of the Villaviciosa product, and the interactive map
  viewer.
